Error [jet.ClosedSetElse]: This `else` stands for cases of the closed set `Int Low!`
  --> tests/ui/closed_else_result_handler.jet:16:9
    |
 16 |         else -> 0
    |         ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Int Low!` is a closed set: an `else` hides which of its cases the arm handles, where naming them keeps the table checked
 Fix: Name the cases instead: `.Err(_) ->`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0641
